{"id":"9412b28b27c8a496e1ac4d36d41c56bde309503b","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1230670","title":"想问各位大佬，现在除了 codex 和 claude 官方的，还有什么推荐的编程客户端","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"xiaomusen12","excerpt":"问与答 - @xiaomusen12 - 想问问各位还有没有推荐的代码编程客户端，主要需要支持多 agent 调用，以及 computer use 协作支持，基本在 mac 平台使用","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n        \n        <p>想问问各位还有没有推荐的代码编程客户端，主要需要支持多 agent 调用，以及 computer use 协作支持，基本在 mac 平台使用</p>\n        \n    </div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/代码\"><li></li> 代码</a><a href=\"/tag/客户端\"><li></li> 客户端</a><a href=\"/tag/编程\"><li></li> 编程</a></P><p><span>9 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-07-29 16:14:30 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17916083\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/38a9fd7d7cee075e8cb30d4dbecf04f7?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ZSWDYHM\" data-uid=\"824846\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ZSWDYHM\">ZSWDYHM</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 12:43:36 +08:00\">22h 24m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>只是编程的话, 我觉得 cursor 越来越好用了.   既有 web 端 ,又有 codex 样式的 agent windows ,还可以随时切回 IDE 看代码 .</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17916140\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ce566dd959c5d20231f8290da9dbbb84?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"xy2401\" data-uid=\"104728\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xy2401\">xy2401</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 13:05:00 +08:00\">22h 3m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>VScode 不用插件 直接配置 api</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17916148\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/46de/7fde/203749_normal.png?m=1740024011\" alt=\"snxq1995\" data-uid=\"203749\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/snxq1995\">snxq1995</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 13:06:42 +08:00\">22h 1m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>习惯了 cli ，有没有命令行好用的其他工具呀</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17916678\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2273/0636/253364_normal.png?m=1749459724\" alt=\"iv8d\" data-uid=\"253364\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/iv8d\">iv8d</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 14:41:35 +08:00\">20h 26m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>opencode, codebuddy,trae,cursor……太多了，你让 AI 给你总结</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17916867\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ddd927d69f7ccbf8e9b5a77c7b8500f5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yinmin\" data-uid=\"108246\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n    